    {
      "id": "claim_6a8f26dd63844269ad8369134ac2dad5",
      "statement": "create_sandbox() dispatches per factory type: coroutine factories (modal) are awaited directly while synchronous factories (daytona, e2b, runloop, local) run on asyncio.to_thread because their SDK wrappers bind synchronous handles or perform synchronous filesystem I/O.",
