    {
      "id": "claim_6e7548eec2574bf59df94dcbab37d823",
      "statement": "Reconnecting to a LangSmith sandbox id that no longer exists raises SandboxGoneError (distinct from a merely unreachable sandbox), signaling callers to recreate rather than fail, because a deleted sandbox holds no working tree.",
